# Auto-use Anthropic skills

Before implementing, if a skill in `C:\Users\DEV\.cursor\skills\` matches the task, **Read its SKILL.md first** and follow it. Do not wait to be asked.

Quick map for this repo:

- New UI / visual redesign / landing / layout polish → `frontend-design`
- Browser / Playwright verification of the app → `webapp-testing`
- PDF / DOCX / XLSX / PPTX deliverables → matching `pdf` / `docx` / `xlsx` / `pptx`
- MCP servers → `mcp-builder`
- Structured docs / specs → `doc-coauthoring`

When editing existing BuddyBoss UI, respect the current design system; still load `frontend-design` for net-new pages or intentional visual redesigns.
